  "why": "Sparks of Tomorrow is a single cour TV run of 13 episodes airing 2026-07-05 to 2026-09-27 (Summer 2026) and still releasing at the time of labelling. The anilist, kitsu and mal rows are one run: anilist gives mal:62856, kitsu gives anilist:103303 and mal:62856, and all three carry the same day precise 2026-07-05 start with 13 episodes, while the two offline rows are keyed on anilist-103303 and mal-62856 and hand back those same ids. nf:81698957 is a bare Netflix title id with no season, no dates and no count, so it holds the run instead of being it. The JustWatch season jw:320096-328355 (10 episodes, a 2026-01-01 start that matches nothing, no episode dates) and the Netflix season nf:81698957-1 (11 episodes, titles Episode 2 through Episode 11, no dates) are each shorter than the still releasing 13 episode run and the catalogue rows carry no episode titles or dates to check them against, so neither is settled here."
